To Check &amp; Download SSC Phase 13 Result 2026\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-end=\"247\" data-start=\"214\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official <strong>SSC</strong> website.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"317\" data-start=\"251\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">On the homepage, find and click on the <strong data-end=\"306\" data-start=\"290\">\u201cAnswer Key\u201d</strong> section.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"402\" data-start=\"321\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Look for the notification titled <strong data-end=\"399\" data-start=\"354\">\u201cSelection Post Phase-13 Result 2026\u201d</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"460\" data-start=\"406\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on the provided link to access the login page.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"548\" data-start=\"464\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your <strong data-end=\"512\" data-start=\"475\">Registration Number / Roll Number</strong> and <strong data-end=\"545\" data-start=\"517\">Password / Date of Birth</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"620\" data-start=\"552\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Submit the details to view your <strong data-end=\"617\" data-start=\"584\">Result and Response Sheet</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"681\" data-start=\"624\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the answer key PDF and save it to your device.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"764\" data-start=\"685\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Match your responses with the official key to calculate your estimated score.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"914\" data-start=\"768\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">If you find any discrepancies, you can submit objections within the given time frame by following the instructions provided in the notification.</span></li>\n<li data-end=\"1041\" data-start=\"919\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">After the objection window closes, SSC will release the <strong data-end=\"995\" data-start=\"975\">result</strong>, which will be used for result preparation.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #ffffff;\">\u00a0SSC Phase 13 Recruitment 2025 : </span>Mode Of Selection\u00a0</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>CBT<br/>\n</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Descriptive<br/>\n</b></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><b>Skill Test<br/>\n</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Join Our WhatsApp Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\">Follow Our Instagram Channel</span></strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Follow Now</a></strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-cbf2939c gb-headline-text\"><strong><strong><strong>SOME USEFUL IMPORTANT LINKS</strong></strong></strong></h6>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-97626626873231