yle=\"font-family: inherit;\"> The tentative/provisional answer key is usually released within <strong data-end=\"448\" data-start=\"420\">7\u201315 days after the exam</strong>.</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Where will the <strong>answer key</strong> be available?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> On the official SSC website, in the <strong data-end=\"582\" data-start=\"543\">Answer Key / Latest Notices section</strong>.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"flex-shrink-0 flex flex-col relative items-end\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"pt-0\">\n<div class=\"gizmo-bot-avatar flex h-8 w-8 items-center justify-center overflow-hidden rounded-full\">\n<ul>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong style=\"font-family: inherit;\">Question:</strong><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"> What details will I need to check the <strong>answer key?</strong></span></span></li>\n<li class=\"relative p-1 rounded-sm flex items-center justify-center bg-token-main-surface-primary text-token-text-primary h-8 w-8\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> Candidates will require their <strong data-end=\"718\" data-start=\"681\">Registration Number / Roll Number</strong> and <strong data-end=\"751\" data-start=\"723\">Password / Date of Birth</strong> to log in and download their response sheet with the answer key.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> Will SSC release the response sheet along with the <strong>answer key?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer: Yes, SSC generally provides both the answer key and the candidate\u2019s response sheet so that you can compare your answers.</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>SSC</strong></span>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website for <span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><strong>SSC </strong></span>is <strong>https://ssc.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"SSC Phase 13 Answer Key 2025\" class=\"size-large wp-image-22441 aligncenter\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/SSC-Phase-13-Answer-Key-2025-1024x576.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/SSC-Phase-13-Answer-Key-2025-1024x576.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/SSC-Phase-13-Answer-Key-2025-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/SSC-Phase-13-Answer-Key-2025-768x432.jpg 768w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/SSC-Phase-13-Answer-Key-2025.jpg 1280w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center wp-block-paragraph\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=in.qmaths.blackbook&amp;referrer=src%3Dsarkariresult.com.cm\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Download English Vocab App</a></strong></p>\n<script async=\"\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" src=\"https://pagead2.googlesyndication.com/pagead/js/adsbygoogle.js?client=ca-pub-9762662687323163\" type=\"